{% comment %}
  One icon, by the name the theme uses for it.

  The same names as the React side (components/Icon.jsx), so a block that says
  `mail` draws the same glyph whether Liquid or React renders it.

  Usage: {% render 'sm-icon', name: 'mail' %}

  An unknown name draws nothing rather than an empty box — asking for a glyph
  that does not exist should be invisible, not a hole in the layout.
{% endcomment %}

